<view class="page print-page"><view class="row between"><view class="title">制作实体卡</view><button class="link" bindtap="back">返回</button></view>
<view class="panel spaced"><view class="section">24张自然收藏卡</view><text class="sub">成品63×88mm · 3mm出血 · 本阶段仅预览与草稿。价格以服务端询价为准。</text><view class="notice spaced">支付未配置，地址与履约未开放。保存草稿不等于下单，不会扣款。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice spaced" aria-live="polite">{{error}}</view><view class="section spaced">已选 {{selected.length}} / 24</view>
<view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="print-row"><view><text>{{item.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.gift}}" class="sub">受赠收藏 · 打印前重新核验授权</text><text wx:if="{{!item.eligible}}" class="sub">{{item.reason}}</text></view><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy||!item.eligible}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle">{{item.selected?'已选 · 移除':'选择'}}</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="sub spaced">还没有可选的真实收藏。请先保存自己的观察卡。</view>
<button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="gifts">加载 / 刷新我的受赠卡</button><view class="sub">明确授权实体打印的赠卡可选择；旧赠卡显示“素材未授权”，请由赠予者撤回旧副本后重新请求并批准。普通分享不授权原照。</view>
<view class="section spaced">本机示意与顺序</view><view class="sub spaced">PNG依据本机卡片生成，仅供版式与照片示意，不是生产文件。印刷内容以服务端项目核对及未来生产打样为准。</view><view wx:for="{{ordered}}" wx:key="serverCardId" class="print-item"><text>{{index+1}} · {{item.name}}</text><view class="print-actions"><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy||index===0}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-direction="-1" bindtap="move">上移</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy||index===ordered.length-1}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-direction="1" bindtap="move">下移</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy||item.gift}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-side="front" bindtap="preview">正面示意PNG</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy||item.gift}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-side="back" bindtap="preview">背面示意PNG</button></view><view wx:if="{{item.gift}}" class="sub">赠卡暂以服务端冻结项目核对；生产图像预览尚未开放，不读取好友原照作本机示意。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{previewPath}}" class="panel spaced"><text class="sub">{{quality}}</text><button class="primary spaced" bindtap="viewPreview">查看本机示意PNG</button></view>
<button class="primary spaced" disabled="{{busy||selected.length!==24}}" bindtap="quote">{{busy?'正在核验…':'核对24张卡与服务端价格'}}</button><view wx:if="{{quote}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">服务端报价 ¥{{quote.totalFen/100}}</view><text class="sub">普通地区包邮政策待履约核验；尚未收集地址，不能支付。</text><view class="section spaced">服务端项目核对</view><view class="sub">以下名称、发现编号和顺序将写入草稿快照；不代表已经生成生产文件。</view><view wx:if="{{!quoteReview.valid}}" class="notice spaced">服务端项目与当前选择不一致，不能保存草稿，请重新询价。</view><view wx:if="{{quoteReview.differenceCount}}" class="notice spaced">有 {{quoteReview.differenceCount}} 张卡与本机示意不同，请逐项核对。示意PNG未自动替换为云端版本。</view><view wx:for="{{quoteReview.rows}}" wx:key="cardId" class="print-item"><view>{{item.position+1}} · {{item.name}}</view><view class="sub">原发现编号 · Discovery No. {{item.number}}</view><view class="sub">Original Discoverer · {{item.originalDiscoverer}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.gift}}" class="sub">Gifted From · {{item.giftedFrom}} · 不计入你的新发现</view><view class="sub">{{item.locationLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.difference}}" class="notice spaced">{{item.difference}} · 本机：{{item.localName||'未找到'}} / {{item.localNumber||'编号未核对'}}</view></view><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{busy||!quoteReview.valid}}" bindtap="saveDraft">保存不可支付的订单草稿</button></view><view wx:if="{{draft}}" class="notice spaced">{{draftCached?'本机缓存 · 待联网重验。':'本次已由服务端核验并保留草稿。'}}未付款、未下单、未提交制作。调整顺序或卡片变化后须重新询价。</view>
</view><canvas type="2d" id="printCanvas" class="print-canvas"/>
<privacy-consent id="nature-privacy"/>
